{
  "about": "Language-decision vectors (PLAN.md section 1, 'Languages'), shared by the macOS and Windows apps. choice: 'auto' or a transcript language (en, zh-TW, zh-CN, de, es). preferred: Settings > General preferred language. detection: null when detection did not run, else a Whisper code (en, zh, de, es; null for no speech; any other code counts as no speech) and a confidence. Confidences are 32-bit floats compared with >= against 0.7 (auto) and 0.85 (fixed-choice suggestion); 0.69999993 and 0.84999996 parse to the float just below each threshold. expect.reason: chosen | detected | fallbackToPreferred; expect.confidence is the detected confidence for 'detected', the detected confidence or null for 'fallbackToPreferred', and null for 'chosen'. expect.suggestion is the language offered for a re-run, or null. Mirrors LanguageDecisionTests.swift.",
  "thresholds": {
    "auto": 0.7,
    "mismatch": 0.85
  },
